hived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-04-08T17:40:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T17:39:38Z","closed_at":"2026-04-08T22:02:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118317","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118317.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118317.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-08T22:02:56Z"},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118110\r\n\r\nThe problem here is that the backing textures for the sky were created based on the `sky->mode` (which defaults to AUTOMATIC). This meant the logic for creating the texture was never changed when the internal mode changed. Leading to a situation where the textures don't match what the shader expects. This led to minor issues in previous releases that would only be noticed on close inspection. \r\n\r\nI noticed this issue a few months ago, but didn't make a PR since it seemed that the problem wasn't super noticeable in practice. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116154, however, made the problem a lot more noticeable since the number of roughness layers needed by the realtime mode now no longer matches the global default. This led to a situation where 8 layers were allocated, but the shader only filled 7 of them. The last layer remained black, which led to all fully rough objects receiving black reflections. \r\n\r\nThe solution is to track the fallback earlier (when the sky is being set up) and then recreate the backing textures when needed. Technically the compatibility renderer doesn't need this change since it doesn't support the REALTIME mode, but I copied the changes over to keep the backends consistent and make it easier to maintain. \r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118317/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118317/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}